    "lem-nrqm-oscillator-closed-ladder-domains": {
      "citations": [
        {
          "fact": "F1",
          "source": "def-orthonormal-family-complete-orthonormal-system-and-hilbert-basis",
          "source_section": "Definition",
          "quote": "Let $H$ be a real or complex inner-product space ([[def-real-and-complex-inner-product-space]]), with inner\nproduct linear in the first argument and conjugate-linear in the second, and\nwith the induced length $\\|v\\|=\\sqrt{\\langle v,v\\rangle}$. The definitions below\ndo not require completeness. When the term *Hilbert basis* is used, $H$ is\nadditionally assumed complete ([[def-hilbert-space]]).",
