            "2.3",
            "3.1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact": "F2",
          "source": "lem-nrqm-oscillator-closed-ladder-domains",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Countable Choice ([[def-countable-choice]]). Let $H$ be a complex Hilbert space ([[def-hilbert-space]]) with inner product linear in the first argument, let $(e_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$, $\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\dots\\}$, be a complete orthonormal family of $H$ ([[def-orthonormal-family-complete-orthonormal-system-and-hilbert-basis]]), and for $x\\in H$ write $c_n:=\\langle x,e_n\\rangle$, s",
          "uses": [
