          "source": "lem-nrqm-composites-hilbert-tensor-construction",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Countable Choice ([[def-countable-choice]]). Let $H,K$ be complex Hilbert spaces with the pairing linear in the first argument ([[def-real-and-complex-inner-product-space]], [[def-hilbert-space]]). Write $H\\odot K$ for the complex vector space of [[def-tensor-product-of-modules-by-generators-and-relations]] applied to $R=\\mathbb C$ and the $\\mathbb C$-modules $H,K$: its underly",
