          ]
        },
        {
          "fact": "F3",
          "source": "thm-nrqm-oscillator-diagonal-spectrum",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Countable Choice ([[def-countable-choice]]). Let $H$ be a complex Hilbert space ([[def-hilbert-space]]), let $(e_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ be a complete orthonormal family of $H$ ([[def-orthonormal-family-complete-orthonormal-system-and-hilbert-basis]]), let $(\\lambda_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\subseteq\\mathbb R$, and let $A$ be the self-adjoint diagonal operator of [[lem-nrqm-oscillator-dia",
