        {
          "fact": "F4",
          "source": "thm-nrqm-oscillator-oscillator-scaling-and-exact-realization",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Countable Choice ([[def-countable-choice]]). Fix real parameters $m>0$, $\\omega>0$, $\\hbar>0$, put $\\ell:=\\sqrt{\\hbar/(m\\omega)}>0$, and let $g_0,P,(g_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ be the Hermite data of [[thm-nrqm-oscillator-hermite-recurrence]] in $L^2(\\mathbb R,dy)$, so that $(g_n)$ is a complete orthonormal family by [[thm-nrqm-oscillator-hermite-completeness]]. Define\n\n$$D:L^2(\\math",
          "uses": [
            "2.2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact": "F5",
          "source": "thm-stars-and-bars",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Let $m \\ge 1$ and write $m = \\sigma(M)$, so $M = m-1$. Then for every\n$n \\in \\mathbb{N}$\n\n$$\\big\\lvert\\mathcal{W}(n,m)\\big\\rvert = \\binom{n+m-1}{\\,m-1\\,} = \\binom{n+M}{M},$$\n\nand the map",
